                        <span class="rounded-full group-data-[aktif=true]:w-1.5 group-data-[aktif=true]:h-1.5 group-data-[aktif=true]:bg-white group-data-[aktif=false]:w-1 group-data-[aktif=false]:h-1 group-data-[aktif=false]:bg-slate-500" />
